rem *** One level at a time: the rig is for comparing our client against the
rem *** original, and that means both standing on the same map.
rem *** Co-op with bots (sv.coopBotCount in serversettings.con): something always
rem *** moves on the server, so other soldiers and vehicles can be measured
rem *** without a second person at the keyboard.
mapList.append strike_at_karkand gpm_coop 16
